---
import Exchange from "../layouts/Exchange.astro";
---
<Exchange title="Tools that belong in your workspace" description="Discover, build, and publish full-workspace tools for Tabs.">
  <section class="marketplace-hero" aria-labelledby="marketplace-title">
  <div class="marketplace-copy">
  <p class="eyebrow">The tools that make your workspace yours</p>
  <h1 id="marketplace-title">More room for your tools.<br /><span class="editorial-accent">One workspace. Your way.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">Discover tools built for Tabs, or build the tool your workflow is missing. One registry connects developers, reviewers, and compatible clients.</p>
  <form class="home-search" action="/extensions" method="get" role="search" aria-label="Search the extension marketplace">
    <label for="home-extension-query">Find your next tool</label>
    <div class="home-search-controls"><input id="home-extension-query" type="search" name="q" maxlength="100" placeholder="Search extensions, publishers, or workflows" /><button class="button" type="submit">Search extensions</button></div>
    <p class="muted">Search published tools. Installation and permission review happen inside Tabs.</p>
  </form>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/extensions">Explore extensions</a><a class="button secondary" href="/developers">Build your first tool</a></div>
  </div>
  </section>
  <div class="cards">
    <section class="card"><h2>Discover</h2><p>Inspect published tools, their compatibility, and requested permissions before installing through Tabs.</p><a href="/extensions">Browse the registry</a></section>
    <section class="card"><h2>Develop</h2><p>Create a React or HTML tool with local bundled assets and a host-managed, permission-aware API.</p><a href="/docs/extensions">Read the developer docs</a></section>
    <section class="card"><h2>Publish</h2><p>Submit a package through your publisher account. Every version requires review and signed publication.</p><a href="/publish">Submit an extension</a></section>
  </div>
  <p class="notice">Staging ecosystem: developer tooling is experimental. Registry availability and publishing permissions depend on this instance. Uploading does not mean a package is public.</p>
</Exchange>
<style>
  .marketplace-hero { padding-top: 48px; }
  .marketplace-copy { min-width: 0; max-width: 860px; }
  .marketplace-hero h1 { max-width: none; font-size: clamp(44px, 6.5vw, 92px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.06em; margin: 24px 0 32px; }
  .marketplace-hero .lead { max-width: 650px; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .home-search { max-width: 860px; margin: 36px 0; text-align: left; }
  .home-search label { display: block; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
  .home-search-controls { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
  .home-search-controls input { min-width: 0; flex: 1; padding: 16px 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--control-radius); background: var(--background); color: var(--ink); font-size: 16px; }
  .home-search p { font-size: 14px; margin: 10px 0 0; }
  .marketplace-hero .actions { margin-top: 8px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .home-search-controls { flex-direction: column; } .marketplace-hero { padding-top: 24px; } }
</style>
